# Fixture: map_found_colony start (France 1599). Tribe villages: Inca 3, Apache 1 (the others 4-19).
# Unlock CHEAT (Alt-W, Alt-I, Alt-N), Shift-F6 opens the Kill Indians list: one row per non-extinct tribe (Inca, Aztec, Arawak, Iroquois, Cherokee, Apache, Sioux, Tupi).
# DOS CHEAT case 0x67 -> FUN_4d56_01e2(id-1): FUN_4d56_00e0 for every village of that tribe, highest index first (no owner-nibble repaint, no indian[] reset).
# Apache (row 5, 1 village) goes extinct -> @EXTINCT popup, Return dismisses. The second Shift-F6 must list 7 rows without Apache; Inca (row 0, 3 villages) is killed next.
# The test ends with cheat mode switched off again (Alt-W), as map_cheat_create_unit does.
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt
key F6 shift             # Kill Indians list
shot
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Return               # Apache
shot                     # @EXTINCT popup
key Return
key F6 shift             # list again: no Apache row
shot
key Return               # Inca
shot
key Return               # @EXTINCT popup dismissed
key w alt                # cheat mode off
shot
